//daj czarny ekran

Two months ago.

<<bg kosciol_retrospekcja>>

The High Priest of Devotion: Father Ariel, I must say you have matched our expectations.
The High Priest of Devotion: You did an excellent job during your seminaries and you have passed every single test with outstanding scores.
The High Priest of Devotion: However, it is just the start of your journey.
The High Priest of Devotion: A few months ago we got a report from Natum Amoris, about a set of peculiar events.
The High Priest of Devotion: The townspeople have started to change, marriages collapsed, families split apart.
The High Priest of Devotion: We had sent an experienced exorcist there already, to confirm if it’s a demonic activity.
The High Priest of Devotion: The state of the village and the people is worse than we originally expected and he needs help. 

<<show ariel basic left>>

Ariel: That sounds terrible Father, but you’re telling me this, because..? 

The High Priest of Devotion: The Church of Love has decided that you are a perfect candidate for this job. Congratulations.

Ariel: Excuse me? 

The High Priest of Devotion: Worry not!
The High Priest of Devotion: You have everything you need.
The High Priest of Devotion: Passion.
The High Priest of Devotion: Courage.
The High Priest of Devotion: Knowledge.
The High Priest of Devotion: And most importantly your heart is full of Love.
The High Priest of Devotion: Any questions?

-> Ariel: No Father, I understand.

-> Ariel: Well actually…

The High Priest of Devotion: Great, since you know everything, you can go pack your bags.

The High Priest of Devotion: You don’t need to pack much.

The High Priest of Devotion: You’re only going there for a few days.

The High Priest of Devotion: Hurry, you don’t have much time left.

<<hide ariel>>

<<jump scene_outside>>

===

